        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "We are investigating elevated error rates affecting metrics writes in prod-us-central-0. Customers in this region may see failed or delayed metrics ingestion, gaps in recent data on dashboards and queries, and alert rules that depend on the affected series may not evaluate as expected.",
